  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "本对话依次演示内置预设 Action,每个 Step 的正文标注了当前调用的预设名。开场:`maimai_dialogue:presets/dialogue_enter`(对话框上移淡入)+ `maimai_dialogue:presets/fade_in`(标记从透明淡入)。",
      "typewriter_interval_ms": 15,
      "actions": [
        {
          "target": "dialogue",
          "action": {
            "type": "reference",
            "id": "maimai_dialogue:presets/dialogue_enter"
          }
        },
        {
          "target": "demo_marker",
          "action": {
            "type": "reference",
            "id": "maimai_dialogue:presets/fade_in"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "`maimai_dialogue:presets/bounce` — 上下弹跳:向上跳起约 15% 再落回原位。非阻塞,打字机可继续推进。",
      "actions": [
        {
          "target": "demo_marker",
          "action": {
            "type": "reference",
            "id": "maimai_dialogue:presets/bounce"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "`maimai_dialogue:presets/wiggle` — 左右扭动:向两侧各摆 5%,摇头般可爱的动作。",
      "actions": [
        {
          "target": "demo_marker",
          "action": {
            "type": "reference",
            "id": "maimai_dialogue:presets/wiggle"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "`maimai_dialogue:presets/pulse` — 缩放脉冲:先放大 8% 再缩回,用来强调当前台词。",
      "actions": [
        {
          "target": "demo_marker",
          "action": {
            "type": "reference",
            "id": "maimai_dialogue:presets/pulse"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "`maimai_dialogue:presets/shake` — 快速抖动:小幅高频左右震动,适合“不行!”“才不是!”这种台词。",
      "actions": [
        {
          "target": "demo_marker",
          "action": {
            "type": "reference",
            "id": "maimai_dialogue:presets/shake"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "`maimai_dialogue:presets/dialogue_shake` — 对话框抖动:整个对话框小幅快速震动,用于表达强烈感情。",
      "actions": [
        {
          "target": "dialogue",
          "action": {
            "type": "reference",
            "id": "maimai_dialogue:presets/dialogue_shake"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "`maimai_dialogue:presets/flash` — 闪烁:透明度骤降再恢复,给受击、惊讶等瞬间反馈。",
      "actions": [
        {
          "target": "demo_marker",
          "action": {
            "type": "reference",
            "id": "maimai_dialogue:presets/flash"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "`maimai_dialogue:presets/pop_in` — 弹性弹出:缩小后放大并轻微过冲,弹性的入场感。",
      "actions": [
        {
          "target": "demo_marker",
          "action": {
            "type": "reference",
            "id": "maimai_dialogue:presets/pop_in"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "`maimai_dialogue:presets/zoom_in` — 放大出现:从接近消失的微小尺寸放大回原位。",
      "actions": [
        {
          "target": "demo_marker",
          "action": {
            "type": "reference",
            "id": "maimai_dialogue:presets/zoom_in"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "`maimai_dialogue:presets/drop_in` — 从上落下:先在上方现形,再加速“落”到原位,有重力感。",
      "actions": [
        {
          "target": "demo_marker",
          "action": {
            "type": "reference",
            "id": "maimai_dialogue:presets/drop_in"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "`maimai_dialogue:presets/slide_in_left` — 左侧滑入:从左边 30% 处平移入场。",
      "actions": [
        {
          "target": "demo_marker",
          "action": {
            "type": "reference",
            "id": "maimai_dialogue:presets/slide_in_left"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "`maimai_dialogue:presets/slide_in_right` — 右侧滑入:从右边 30% 处平移入场。",
      "actions": [
        {
          "target": "demo_marker",
          "action": {
            "type": "reference",
            "id": "maimai_dialogue:presets/slide_in_right"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "`maimai_dialogue:presets/slide_in_up` — 下方滑入:从下方 25% 处上移入场。",
      "actions": [
        {
          "target": "demo_marker",
          "action": {
            "type": "reference",
            "id": "maimai_dialogue:presets/slide_in_up"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "`maimai_dialogue:presets/slide_in_down` — 上方滑入:从上方 25% 处下移入场。",
      "actions": [
        {
          "target": "demo_marker",
          "action": {
            "type": "reference",
            "id": "maimai_dialogue:presets/slide_in_down"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "背景只能切换差分,没有通用预设:用 inline Action 把背景切到 `alternate`。标记同时再 `maimai_dialogue:presets/pulse` 一下。",
      "actions": [
        {
          "target": "background",
          "action": {
            "type": "inline",
            "action": {
              "duration_ms": 500,
              "easing": "ease_in_out",
              "variant": {
                "at": 0.55,
                "value": "alternate"
              }
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "target": "demo_marker",
          "action": {
            "type": "reference",
            "id": "maimai_dialogue:presets/pulse"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "`maimai_dialogue:presets/hide` — 隐藏:立即把标记设为不可见。",
      "actions": [
        {
          "target": "demo_marker",
          "action": {
            "type": "reference",
            "id": "maimai_dialogue:presets/hide"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "`maimai_dialogue:presets/show` — 显示:立即恢复可见,与 hide 相对。",
      "actions": [
        {
          "target": "demo_marker",
          "action": {
            "type": "reference",
            "id": "maimai_dialogue:presets/show"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "`maimai_dialogue:presets/fade_out` — 淡出:逐渐变透明直至消失。退出类预设以 −1 偏移结尾,要求进入该步时对象透明度为 1。",
      "actions": [
        {
          "target": "demo_marker",
          "action": {
            "type": "reference",
            "id": "maimai_dialogue:presets/fade_out"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "上一步结束后标记已透明,先内联恢复:`opacity` 0 → 1.0(相对偏移)重新回到 100% 透明度,以便继续演示下一个退场。",
      "actions": [
        {
          "target": "demo_marker",
          "action": {
            "type": "inline",
            "action": {
              "duration_ms": 350,
              "easing": "ease_out",
              "blocking": true,
              "opacity": [
                {
                  "at": 0.0,
                  "value": 0.0
                },
                {
                  "at": 1.0,
                  "value": 1.0
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "`maimai_dialogue:presets/slide_out_left` — 向左滑出:边移动边淡出离场。",
      "actions": [
        {
          "target": "demo_marker",
          "action": {
            "type": "reference",
            "id": "maimai_dialogue:presets/slide_out_left"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "再次用 inline Action 恢复透明度(0 → 1.0)。",
      "actions": [
        {
          "target": "demo_marker",
          "action": {
            "type": "inline",
            "action": {
              "duration_ms": 350,
              "easing": "ease_out",
              "blocking": true,
              "opacity": [
                {
                  "at": 0.0,
                  "value": 0.0
                },
                {
                  "at": 1.0,
                  "value": 1.0
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "`maimai_dialogue:presets/rise_out` — 向上飘走:缓缓上升并淡出,轻盈的离场。",
      "actions": [
        {
          "target": "demo_marker",
          "action": {
            "type": "reference",
            "id": "maimai_dialogue:presets/rise_out"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "继续用 inline Action 恢复透明度(0 → 1.0)。",
      "actions": [
        {
          "target": "demo_marker",
          "action": {
            "type": "inline",
            "action": {
              "duration_ms": 350,
              "easing": "ease_out",
              "blocking": true,
              "opacity": [
                {
                  "at": 0.0,
                  "value": 0.0
                },
                {
                  "at": 1.0,
                  "value": 1.0
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "`maimai_dialogue:presets/shrink_out` — 缩小消失:一边缩小一边淡出。",
      "actions": [
        {
          "target": "demo_marker",
          "action": {
            "type": "reference",
            "id": "maimai_dialogue:presets/shrink_out"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "最后一次恢复透明度(0 → 1.0),标记回到完全可见的初始状态。",
      "actions": [
        {
          "target": "demo_marker",
          "action": {
            "type": "inline",
            "action": {
              "duration_ms": 350,
              "easing": "ease_out",
              "blocking": true,
              "opacity": [
                {
                  "at": 0.0,
                  "value": 0.0
